WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.635
Endurance?

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:15.640
Yes! My brother said your endurance
doesn't change when you become a Mask.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.936
So if you focus on defense first
and exhaust the enemy's energy,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.646
you'll be at an advantage.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:29.696
Great, all according to plan.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.323
I can win. I'm stronger now.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.368
I'm so happy I can help Honjo out!

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.579
Mayuko, I'm so sorry.

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:38.580
You got this!

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.213
This is my chance!

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.719
This is for my family!

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.013
-What?
-Stay back!

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:06.941
Damn you.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.527
Oh, dear.

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:25.543
Seems like she's getting pretty tired.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.711
All right!

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.380
Ein won't make it much longer.

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:30.757
Okay, then.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.554
I'll take out her right arm!

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.264
This is it.

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:40.266
It's your turn, Zwei!

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.396
You fools!

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.774
You thought Ein was
the only Mask I could control?

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:56.741
-Zwei.
-Zwei!

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:01.871
What?

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.624
She saw right through my strategy?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.960
That dumb-looking girl?

